{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>strategic turn-based deck-building game</strong>, you'll take on the challenge of defending settlements with carefully chosen cards, buildings, and strategies. This demo gives you a first taste of the adventure, allowing you to experience the <strong>Green Forest phase</strong> with its unique challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/maps.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forests:</strong> 15 levels filled with battles, treasures, shops, campfires, and a climactic boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as the Dwarven Class:</strong> Focus on <strong>defense-oriented strategies</strong>, fortifying your settlements and enduring enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/build.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps:</strong> Each run features a dynamically generated path, ensuring a unique experience every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck-Building &amp; Strategy:</strong> 30 distinct cards to collect and use in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful Relics:</strong> 8 relics to enhance your strategies and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Enemy Encounters:</strong> Face 10 different enemy battles, leading up to the first boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Settlement Defense:</strong> Construct 10 unique buildings, each with 3 upgrade levels, to strengthen your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/attack.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Status Effects:</strong> Utilize 5 different statuses that impact battles in strategic ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you withstand the rising tide of darkness and master the art of deck-building and strategy? Try the demo and begin your journey in <strong>Kingdom Fortress</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538650?t=1740756498","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538650?t=1740756498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/5e503adde22faf3205a0d9abe16549b58377d977/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740756498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/5e503adde22faf3205a0d9abe16549b58377d977/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740756498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>strategic turn-based deck-building game</strong>, you'll take on the challenge of defending settlements with carefully chosen cards, buildings, and strategies. This demo gives you a first taste of the adventure, allowing you to experience the <strong>Green Forest phase</strong> with its unique challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/maps.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forests:</strong> 15 levels filled with battles, treasures, shops, campfires, and a climactic boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as the Dwarven Class:</strong> Focus on <strong>defense-oriented strategies</strong>, fortifying your settlements and enduring enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/build.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps:</strong> Each run features a dynamically generated path, ensuring a unique experience every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck-Building &amp; Strategy:</strong> 30 distinct cards to collect and use in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful Relics:</strong> 8 relics to enhance your strategies and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Enemy Encounters:</strong> Face 10 different enemy battles, leading up to the first boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Settlement Defense:</strong> Construct 10 unique buildings, each with 3 upgrade levels, to strengthen your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/extras/attack.gif?t=1740756498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Status Effects:</strong> Utilize 5 different statuses that impact battles in strategic ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you withstand the rising tide of darkness and master the art of deck-building and strategy? Try the demo and begin your journey in <strong>Kingdom Fortress</strong>!</p>","developers":["Martcororo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3341630","name":"Kingdom Fortress"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538650/header.jpg?t=1740756498","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098910,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic